5. Duplication check: is druglisting[source==agora] the agora file?
==============================================================================
  agora file rows          : 109689
  druglisting agora rows   : 124842
  vendor sets: agora=3192 druglisting-agora=2922 shared=2906 (91.0% of agora)
  row counts differ 109689 vs 124842 (ratio 0.879) -- not a row-for-row copy
  but the seller sets overlap 91.0%, so they are the SAME market
  observed at different crawl completeness. Handle-level multi-homing
  across files is therefore NOT evidence of cross-market operation.

